}}

==Overview==
In the [[Korok Forest]], [[Link]] can encounter [[Peeks]], who reveals that he prepared a trial for him.<ref>{{Cite|Peeks thought of a trial that will make Mr. Hero stronger! You won't have to fight, and it's not scary!|Peeks|BotW}}</ref> He wants to see a [[Blupee]], even if it is just a [[Picture]].<ref>{{Cite|BUT you'll need to be extra careful! So... I wanna see a {{Color BotW|Red|Blupee}}! It's a blue, glowy, hoppy thing that glows in the dark! Just about Peeks's size! I just really want to see a {{Color BotW|Red|Blupee}}! Even if it's just a picture of one!|Peeks|BotW}}</ref> When Link agrees to help, Peeks will be grateful.<ref>{{Cite|[I'll help you out.] I knew you were a nice guy, Mr. Hero! Thanks for listening to Peeks's request!|Peeks|BotW}}</ref> While he does not know where to find a Blupee, he has heard that creatures like them have been spotted throughout [[Hyrule Kingdom]].<ref>{{Cite|So...I don't know where they live, but I heard there are little blue glowing critters hopping around Hyrule.|Peeks|BotW}}</ref> Peeks is curious about the glow of Blupees and asks if Link feels the same.<ref>{{Cite|Apparently they're called {{Color BotW|Red|Blupees}}! I wonder how glowy they are! Aren't you curious?|Peeks|BotW}}</ref> He promises a gift if Link can show him one.<ref>{{Cite|If you show me a {{Color BotW|Red|Blupee}}, I'll be sure to thank you with a gift! Good luck!|Peeks|BotW}}</ref>

Blupees can be found in the forest surrounding [[Cotera's Great Fairy Fountain]] near [[Kakariko Village]], as well as in other woodlands. They also appear on [[Satori Mountain]] on nights that the [[Lord of the Mountain]] appears. Using the [[Camera]] [[Rune]], Link can take a Picture of a Blupee.

Once Link has a Picture, he can return to show it to Peeks.<ref>{{Cite|Oh! Mr. Hero! Did you bring it for me?|Peeks|BotW}}</ref> Peeks is shocked by its appearance, saying it is even more beautiful than he could have imagine.<ref>{{Cite|W-w-wait a minute! Is that a real {{Color BotW|Red|Blupee}}?! Wow! It's even more beautiful than {{Color BotW|Blue|Peeks}} imagined!|Peeks|BotW}}</ref> Having seen a Blupee, Peeks is content.<ref>{{Cite|Thanks so much, Mr. Hero! Now I'm content!|Peeks|BotW}}</ref> As a reward, he gives Link a [[Silver Rupee]].<ref>{{Cite|...Oh! And here's a litle thank-you gift! Peeks didn't forget!|Peeks|BotW}}</ref>

When he hands Link the [[Rupee]], Peeks realizes that he might find himself in need of money.<ref>{{Cite|Oh, yeah! Mr. Hero needs rupees sometimes, right?|Peeks|BotW}}</ref> He suggest that Link shoot [[Arrow]]s at Blupees if he is ever desperate, as they drop Rupees when hit.<ref>{{Cite|If you desperately need rupees...you should shoot an arrow at a {{Color BotW|Blue|blupee}}! I hear they drop lots of rupees if you hit them.|Peeks|BotW}}</ref> Before the Side Quest ends, Peeks once again expresses how happy he is to have seen a Blupee.<ref>{{Cite|Oh, man! I'm so glad I got to see something so cool! Peeks is so happy right now!|Peeks|BotW}}</ref>

